  {
   "type": "product_header",
   "title": "»hyperion«",
   "text": "<p>通过精确预调的车削刀具提高生产效率</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ch/%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A/%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC\">立即咨询</a></p>",
   "img": {
